  "content": "\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img alt=\"Plants & Zombies\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/bd043e85c697f9ee5a2bcc8dbf022e820a5a99ca.png\" />\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\"><font size=6>Minecraft 的《植物大戰殭屍》模組。</font></p>\n\n\n\nPlants & Zombies 是一款以《植物大戰殭屍》為主題的模組，致力於將該遊戲的機制與角色以完全融合且適合生存模式的方式加入 Minecraft。本模組新增了超過 20 種獨特生物，以及若干獨特方塊與物品。\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n<iframe width=\"560\" height=\"315\" src=\"https://www.youtube-nocookie.com/embed/PT-nEbOjtek\" title=\"YouTube video player\" frameborder=\"0\" allow=\"accelerometer; autoplay; clipboard-write; encrypted-media; gyroscope; picture-in-picture; web-share\" allowfullscreen></iframe>\n</p>\n\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img alt=\"Page Break\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/1b02c40d42345d59d1bbd86422d32ad842158f5e.png\" />\n</p>\n\n<p><font size=6>功能與備註：</font></p>\n<details>\n\n- 各種類型的有益植物會在特定生態域中自然生成。\n\n- 若要馴服並放置這些植物，需要消耗「陽光」。\n\n- 陽光也可用於從植物身上獲取更多種子。\n\n- 陽光可從產出陽光的植物中獲得。不過，摧毀植物也會提供少量陽光。\n\n- 自然生成的殭屍有極小機率會生成為「首領殭屍」。這些殭屍擁有更高的生命值，並且能召喚援軍。它們會攜帶一面旗幟。\n\n- 特殊類型的殭屍在特定條件下會自然生成。\n\n- 某些特殊殭屍僅能在「殭屍襲擊」事件中遭遇。\n\n- 植物只能種植在有效的地面上或花盆中。\n\n- 種植於花盆中的植物對殭屍及其他敵人的防禦力會有所提升。\n\n<summary>劇透</summary>\n</details>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img alt=\"Page Break\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/db7db2efe8bd477ece43af9224e4b11afb9e004e.png\" />\n</p>\n\n<a href= \"https://apexhost.gg/joshxviii\">\n  <img alt=\"Apex Hosting Promotion\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/57636b37e49722cb214faf1627dec87c54760f5e.png\"/>\n</a>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href= \"https://discord.gg/edvrzDaGNQ\">\n    <img alt=\"DISCORD\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/1a715fd4318edcf1027d679da53646c6f62f68c9.png\"/>\n  </a>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <a href= \"https://github.com/joshxviii/plants-and-zombies\">\n    <img alt=\"GITHUB\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/707128723ef476b3bf574980beaa7bbcfee9ac95.png\"/>\n  </a>\n</p>\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img alt=\"Page Break\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/1b02c40d42345d59d1bbd86422d32ad842158f5e.png\" />\n</p>\n\n**<p align=\"center\"><font size=5>培育與農場經營！</font></p>**\n\n![農田上耕作土壤中的向日葵群](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/746c12676147509293086bd8067f4ad2c751ffa9.png)\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img alt=\"Page Break\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/db7db2efe8bd477ece43af9224e4b11afb9e004e.png\" />\n</p>\n\n**<p align=\"center\"><font size=5>在自然棲息地中搜尋與發現植物！</font></p>**\n\n![地獄中的火焰豌豆射手、太陽菇與魅惑菇](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/a1e85532ec89927b2bd021fbb3f5519e821ec66b.png)\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img alt=\"Page Break\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/1b02c40d42345d59d1bbd86422d32ad842158f5e.png\" />\n</p>\n\n**<p align=\"center\"><font size=5>戰鬥並抵禦殭屍襲擊！</font></p>**\n\n![殭屍靠近植物旗幟](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/6735db4a34aaeb90e2913e10ad9eaf98551a6e06.png)\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img alt=\"Page Break\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/db7db2efe8bd477ece43af9224e4b11afb9e004e.png\" />\n</p>\n\n**<p align=\"center\"><font size=5>寄信與收信？</font></p>**\n\n![藍色郵箱，報紙從中溢出](https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/7493da5f60a3a94e571cec4cea2c5eae774e1e05.png)\n\n<p align=\"center\">\n  <img alt=\"Page Break\" src=\"https://cdn.modrinth.com/data/cached_images/1b02c40d42345d59d1bbd86422d32ad842158f5e.png\" />\n</p>",
